OL,3,ADisruption at Port of Dover due to
OL,4,A'stop the boats' protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police, which made no arrests,
OL,7,Fdescribed it as a "spontaneous"
OL,8,Fprotest, while Mike Tapp MP said
OL,9,Fquestions need to be asked around why
OL,10,F"it would appear that the police didn't
OL,11,Fknow about it".
